{"isTeamAdminOrOwner logic uses && instead of || which requires both admin AND owner, making permission false for users who are only admin or only owner": 0.9477528929710388, "MultiEmail component initialized with [''] causes validation to fail before user edits - consider starting with empty array": 0.3253800570964813, "isTeamAdmin/isTeamOwner calls should be parallelized with Promise.all instead of serial awaits": 0.04562247171998024, "organizer lookup uses booking.userId || 0 which will cause findFirstOrThrow to throw if booking.userId is null/undefined - should add descriptive error earlier": 0.42094266414642334, "isTeamAdmin/isTeamOwner calls with teamId 0 when booking has no team may be unnecessary - should short-circuit if no teamId": 0.0551079660654068, "ZAddGuestsInputSchema allows empty array - consider adding .min(1) to fail-fast on client": 0.07698681950569153, "Error message translation in mutation onError uses err.message as translation key without fallback if key doesn't exist": 0.29119959473609924, "createMany for attendees could fail on race conditions if concurrent adds create duplicates - consider using upsert or handling unique constraint error": 0.28094348311424255, "Blacklist parsing doesn't trim spaces - env var with spaces like 'a@x.com, b@y.com' will have spaces remain in emails": 0.9616512656211853, "Error logging in sendAddGuestsEmails catch block only logs string message, not the actual error object": 0.9084969758987427, "New i18n keys added only in en/common.json - need to ensure keys exist for other locales": 0.04017286002635956, "MultiEmail inputs lack aria attributes linking to label - EmailField label prop is empty, may cause accessibility issues": 0.011341175995767117, "Missing unit/integration tests for addGuests.handler, AddGuestsDialog, and email sending": 0.11471111327409744, "Consider rate limiting addGuests endpoint or limiting number of guests per call to prevent abuse": 0.8617038130760193}